I001 [*] Import block is un-sorted or un-formatted
  --> export_imports_basedpython.by:1:1
   |
 1 | / from b export z
 2 | | from a import y
 3 | | import os
 4 | |
 5 | | # an `export` statement never merges with a plain `import` one for the same
 6 | | # module — they mean different things
 7 | | from math export pi
 8 | | from math import e
 9 | |
10 | | from math export (
11 | |     floor,
12 | |     ceil,
13 | | )
   | |_^
   |
help: Organize imports
   |
   - from b export z
   - from a import y
1  | import os
2  |
3  | # an `export` statement never merges with a plain `import` one for the same
4  | # module — they mean different things
   - from math export pi
   - from math import e
   -
5  | from math export (
6  +     ceil,
7  |     floor,
   -     ceil,
8  +     pi,
9  | )
